I really Never inteded to make another version of this project but i found my self that i have created a completly different code
for a single project.

What is the difference Between V0.1.3 and V2.0?
it's the code what is different.
The old V0.1.3 uses a very beginner and complex code that is hard to read only the Universe knows what i wrote there back then,
but this newer version V2.0 uses classes and it's more readable than the old one and this time it uses, methods and property decoration
for some parts of the code like the pin and the balance which i made those private class attributes or non-public class attributes.

The old version never really had any number generation it was just a virtual system that let's you deduct, add and transfer with no reallty.
but this newer version which is V2.0 once you create an account it first checks of the Username is already taken if not it will let you have
the username, else it will point that the username is already taken.
Once you create a Username, Password and a 6-Digit pin, it will create a random phone number for you which is a Somali phone Number, it's completly random
like how they generate phone numbers for us when we ask them.
after your create your account, it will be saved inside test.json file and it will be visible to you and you can login to that same account that was created.

Why am i adding this project inside the old project?
Because i wanna look back in the future and tell my self, "You have come along way studying" and to compare my beginner codes with my current prgoress.

**---Features---**

**New Features**: 
1. Local Money Transfer: You Can now transfer money to another exiting account by the phone number (NEW)
2. CBOS Banking, Bank-to-Bank Transfers: You Can now transfer money from your bank account to another exiting bank account (NEW)
3. Bank Withdraw: You Can withdraw the money inside your CBOS Bank Balance into the Local Mobile Balance (NEW)
4. Account Suspension: if both, the bank and the Local Money Account are suspended, you can no longer use them (NEW)
5. Each User can now create a separate bank account if they don't have an existing bank account and there is $10 fee for opening the account,
and once they open an account, they cannot open a second one (NEW)
6. Everything is Saved in the JSON file such as: Usernames, passwords, Pins, balance, and basic user information.

**Coming Features**:
1. Deposit Money From the Local Money into the Bank Account
2. Bank PIN change

The only thing left if Just these two and the project will be completed 100%

